player.text:
Hi {name},

{cancelledBy, select, player {You cancelled} admin {Our team had to cancel} other {{coach} cancelled}} the {service} session on {when}.

{tier, select, free {{amount} is refunded to you in full.} partial {The cancellation came after the free-cancellation deadline, so {refund} is refunded to you and the rest goes to the coach. The refund is processed at the session's original start time.} other {The cancellation came after the refund deadline, so the payment goes to the coach.}}

The attached update removes the session from your calendar. Book another time: {url}

coach.text:
Hi {name},

{cancelledBy, select, coach {You cancelled} admin {Our team had to cancel} other {{player} cancelled}} the {service} session on {when}. The slot is open again.

{tier, select, free {The player was refunded in full.} other {Because the cancellation came late, you receive {coachNet} once the session's original start time has passed. Until then you can refund the player in full from your sessions.}}

The attached update removes the session from your calendar.
{sessionsLine}

player.text:
Hi {name},

{disputeKind, select, player_reported {We received your report about the {service} session with {coach} on {when}. The payment stays on hold until our team reviews it; you will get an email with the outcome.} coach_no_show {Our records show that {coach} did not join the {service} session on {when}. You have not been charged for nothing: the payment is on hold.} no_attendance {Our records show that nobody joined the {service} session with {coach} on {when}. The payment is on hold.} other {We could not tell from our records whether the {service} session with {coach} on {when} took place. The payment is on hold.}}{systemLine}

